  "name": "splat-preh-001",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tPrehnite Specimen (preh-001) \u2014 Gaussian Splat\n\t\n\nPrehnite specimen with extensive reconstruction history \u2014 14+ training iterations spanning multiple capture sessions, background removal approaches, and cleanup chains. The final selected PLY is reruns/v14/FINAL/cleaned.ply (v10-cleaned-aggressive, 14,707 Gaussians).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tSpecimen Details\n\t\n\n\nMineral: Prehnite (green crystal)\nListed on: Borussia Minerals\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tCapture Sessions\n\t\n\nMultiple capture and image-processing variants were\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/idirectships/splat-preh-001.",
